      "roman": "eo",
      "say": "어",
      "name_ko": "어",
      "tip_uz": "\"o\"ga yaqin, lekin lablar yumaloqlanmaydi, og'iz ochiq qoladi.",
      "tip_en": "Like \"u\" in \"bus\" said deeper; the lips stay unrounded.",
